OL,3,GNEWSAMum opens play cafe to fight
OL,4,Apostpartum loneliness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum is opening a new social space for
OL,7,Fparents and children following her own
OL,8,Fexperiences dealing with a lack of
OL,9,Fpostpartum support.
OL,11,FSarah Elliott, from Kettering, said
OL,12,FElliott's Play Cafe, which opens from
OL,13,F31 August, will provide a network for
OL,14,Fnew parents feeling isolated.
OL,16,FMore than 60% of new parents experience
OL,17,Floneliness and isolation at least some
OL,18,Fof the time, according to the National
OL,19,FChildbirth Trust (NCT).
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
